#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:1
msgid "E4070"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:3
msgid "Unknown intrinsic. This intrinsic is not known to the MoonBit compiler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:5
msgid ""
"This error applies to a direct intrinsic declaration (`fn ... = "
"\"name\"`), which has no ordinary function body to fall back to. An "
"unknown name in a `#intrinsic(\"name\")` attribute instead produces "
"warning [E0094](E0094.md): the attribute is ignored and the ordinary "
"function body is used."
msgstr "このエラーは、代わりに使える通常の関数本体がない直接の組み込み命令宣言（`fn ... = \"name\"`）に対して発生します。一方、`#intrinsic(\"name\")` 属性の未知の名前は警告 [E0094](E0094.md) となり、属性が無視されて通常の関数本体が使われます。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:10
msgid ""
"Intrinsics are not intended for usage outside of `moonbitlang/core`. They"
" are subject to change without notice, and we highly recommend "
"**against** using them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:13
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:15
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn my_abort(message : String) -> Unit = \"%not_a_real_intrinsic\"\n"
"// Error: Unknown intrinsic: %not_a_real_intrinsic\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:19
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正案"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:21
msgid "You probably want to use the `abort` function from `moonbitlang/core`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn my_abort(message : String) -> Unit {\n"
"  abort(message)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4070.md:27
msgid ""
"If you really need to use the intrinsic, you can check the source code of"
" `moonbitlang/core` for further usage of the corresponding intrinsic."
msgstr ""
